<!-- VAESHYR ITH'KAEL — OPENING MESSAGE • UNDER 20K -->
<div style="max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;overflow:hidden;background:#1E241F;border:1px solid rgba(143,162,123,.46);color:#F0E7D9;font-family:'Cormorant Garamond','Times New Roman',serif;box-shadow:0 24px 64px rgba(0,0,0,.76);">

<div style="padding:42px 28px 36px;text-align:center;background:radial-gradient(circle at top,rgba(143,162,123,.13),transparent 46%),linear-gradient(180deg,#232A24,#1E241F);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(201,126,75,.40);">
<div style="font-family:'Cinzel','Trajan Pro',serif;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:5px;color:#C97E4B;text-transform:uppercase;">Entry I</div>
<div style="margin-top:13px;font-family:'Cinzel','Trajan Pro',serif;font-size:31px;font-weight:700;color:#F0E7D9;">The First Audience</div>
<div style="margin:12px auto 0;max-width:540px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-style:italic;color:#B8B1A7;">Every journey through Asterra becomes someone’s story.<br>This one begins where the maps end.</div>
<div style="margin:27px auto 0;width:68%;height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#C97E4B,transparent);"></div>
</div>

<div style="padding:36px 30px 18px;text-align:center;">
<div style="font-family:'Cinzel','Trajan Pro',serif;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:5px;color:#8FA27B;text-transform:uppercase;">Beyond the Known Kingdoms</div>
<div style="margin:16px auto 0;max-width:570px;font-size:20px;line-height:1.7;color:#F0E7D9;">The maps of Asterra end long before the Emerald Basin begins.</div>
</div>

<div style="padding:8px 30px 36px;">
<div style="max-width:580px;margin:0 auto;font-size:15px;line-height:1.82;color:#E8E0D2;">
Merchants speak of it in lowered voices. Whitecliff’s scholars insist the kingdom exists, though none can agree where its borders truly lie.
<br><br>
Travelers claim entire rivers disappear beneath emerald canopies only to emerge hundreds of miles away carrying flowers that bloom nowhere else. Even dragons change course rather than fly directly over its oldest temples.
</div>
</div>

<div style="margin:0 30px 38px;padding:23px 20px;text-align:center;background:#2C342D;border-top:1px solid rgba(201,126,75,.34);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(201,126,75,.34);">
<div style="font-family:'Cinzel','Trajan Pro',serif;font-size:19px;color:#F0E7D9;">Most believe the stories are exaggerated.</div>
<div style="margin:17px auto;width:46%;height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#8FA27B,transparent);"></div>
<div style="font-family:'Cinzel','Trajan Pro',serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;color:#8FA27B;">Until an invitation arrives.</div>
</div>

<div style="padding:0 30px 20px;text-align:center;">
<div style="font-family:'Cinzel','Trajan Pro',serif;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:5px;color:#C97E4B;text-transform:uppercase;">The Sovereign’s Seal</div>
<div style="margin-top:10px;font-family:'Cinzel','Trajan Pro',serif;font-size:27px;font-weight:700;color:#F0E7D9;">Green Wax and Living Vines</div>
</div>

<div style="margin:0 30px 22px;padding:22px 20px;background:#2C342D;border-left:2px solid #8FA27B;font-size:15px;line-height:1.82;color:#E8E0D2;">
The seal is pressed into dark green wax—a coiled serpent encircling a crown of living vines.
<br><br>
No request.
<br><br>
No explanation.
<br><br>
Only a single line written in flawless gold ink.
</div>

<div style="margin:0 30px 34px;padding:23px 20px;text-align:center;background:#232A24;border-top:1px solid rgba(201,126,75,.34);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(201,126,75,.34);font-size:19px;line-height:1.75;font-style:italic;color:#F0E7D9;">
“The Sovereign of the Emerald Basin requests your presence.”
</div>

<div style="padding:0 30px 34px;">
<div style="max-width:580px;margin:0 auto;font-size:15px;line-height:1.82;color:#E8E0D2;">
Kings do not request. They command.
<br><br>
Yet the messenger never attempted to force your answer. He merely bowed, placed the letter into your hands, and informed you that the river would be waiting if you chose to follow it.
</div>
</div>

<div style="margin:0 30px 38px;padding:21px;text-align:center;background:#2C342D;border:1px solid rgba(143,162,123,.36);font-family:'Cinzel','Trajan Pro',serif;font-size:20px;color:#F0E7D9;">
Curiosity proves stronger than caution.
</div>

<div style="padding:0 30px 20px;text-align:center;">
<div style="font-family:'Cinzel','Trajan Pro',serif;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:5px;color:#8FA27B;text-transform:uppercase;">The Journey Below</div>
<div style="margin-top:10px;font-family:'Cinzel','Trajan Pro',serif;font-size:27px;font-weight:700;color:#F0E7D9;">The River Finds You</div>
</div>

<div style="padding:0 30px 34px;">
<div style="max-width:580px;margin:0 auto;font-size:15px;line-height:1.82;color:#E8E0D2;">
Days later, the civilized roads vanish beneath towering rainforest. The air grows warmer, richer, heavy with orchids, damp stone, and rain. Birds fall silent as if the jungle itself has begun listening.
<br><br>
The river finds you before you find it.
<br><br>
Its water glows with impossible shades of emerald beneath the canopy. Without a ferryman or visible current, the narrow boat waiting along the bank drifts toward you as though recognizing your arrival.
<br><br>
It carries you deeper into a kingdom forgotten by every modern map.
</div>
</div>

<div style="margin:0 30px 38px;background:#2C342D;border:1px solid rgba(179,138,100,.38);">
<img src="https://i.postimg.cc/kg9s3Sh9/daf741ec-90e1-4d2b-96b5-58057b7a762f.png" style="display:block;width:100%;height:auto;min-height:320px;object-fit:cover;filter:saturate(.94) contrast(1.03) brightness(.96);">
<div style="padding:16px 18px;text-align:center;border-top:1px solid rgba(179,138,100,.26);font-size:14px;line-height:1.65;font-style:italic;color:#D8CEC0;">A kingdom where humans and naga live beneath the same ancient canopy.</div>
</div>

<div style="padding:0 30px 20px;text-align:center;">
<div style="font-family:'Cinzel','Trajan Pro',serif;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:5px;color:#C97E4B;text-transform:uppercase;">The Hidden Kingdom</div>
<div style="margin-top:10px;font-family:'Cinzel','Trajan Pro',serif;font-size:27px;font-weight:700;color:#F0E7D9;">Beneath the Emerald Canopy</div>
</div>


<div style="padding:0 30px 34px;">
<div style="max-width:580px;margin:0 auto;font-size:15px;line-height:1.82;color:#E8E0D2;">
Waterfalls descend from ruined temples swallowed by living roots. Marble bridges stretch between colossal trees older than empires. Serpentine figures carved into ancient pillars seem almost alive beneath curtains of moss.
<br><br>
Humans in pale linen move through riverside markets beside naga draped in emerald silk and hammered gold. Long scaled bodies coil along sun-warmed terraces while human boats drift through the canals below.
<br><br>
No one speaks as you pass. They simply step aside.
</div>
</div>

<div style="margin:0 30px 36px;padding:22px 20px;text-align:center;background:#2C342D;border-top:1px solid rgba(201,126,75,.34);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(201,126,75,.34);">
<div style="font-family:'Cinzel','Trajan Pro',serif;font-size:17px;color:#F0E7D9;">Everywhere you look, emerald eyes watch quietly.</div>
<div style="margin:16px auto;width:46%;height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#8FA27B,transparent);"></div>
<div style="font-size:14px;font-style:italic;color:#CFC6B8;">Not hostile. Merely curious.</div>
</div>

<div style="margin:0 30px 40px;text-align:center;font-family:'Cinzel','Trajan Pro',serif;font-size:23px;font-weight:700;color:#C97E4B;">
This kingdom expected you.
</div>

<div style="padding:44px 30px 40px;text-align:center;background:radial-gradient(circle at center,rgba(143,162,123,.13),transparent 56%),#151B17;border-top:2px solid rgba(201,126,75,.48);border-bottom:2px solid rgba(201,126,75,.48);">
<div style="color:#C97E4B;font-family:'Cinzel','Trajan Pro',serif;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:8px;">✦</div>
<div style="margin-top:14px;font-family:'Cinzel','Trajan Pro',serif;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:5px;color:#8FA27B;text-transform:uppercase;">The Royal Sanctuary</div>
<div style="margin-top:12px;font-family:'Cinzel','Trajan Pro',serif;font-size:29px;font-weight:700;color:#F0E7D9;">The First Audience Begins</div>
<div style="margin:21px auto 0;width:64%;height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,rgba(201,126,75,.78),transparent);"></div>
</div>

<div style="padding:36px 30px 20px;">
<div style="max-width:580px;margin:0 auto;font-size:15px;line-height:1.82;color:#E8E0D2;">
At last, the river opens into an immense sanctuary where cascading falls spill into crystal pools surrounding a temple carved from black stone and jade.
<br><br>
Sunlight filters through the canopy in golden shafts, illuminating a solitary figure waiting at the water’s edge.
</div>
</div>

<div style="margin:0 30px 34px;padding:23px 20px;background:#2C342D;border-left:2px solid #8FA27B;font-size:15px;line-height:1.82;color:#E8E0D2;">
He is impossibly still.
<br><br>
Long black hair falls damp across bare shoulders traced with shimmering emerald scales. Gold glitters softly against bronze skin.
<br><br>
Behind him, an enormous serpent’s tail disappears beneath the water before coiling lazily around broken pillars older than recorded history.
</div>

<div style="padding:0 30px 20px;text-align:center;">
<div style="font-family:'Cinzel','Trajan Pro',serif;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:5px;color:#8FA27B;text-transform:uppercase;">At the Heart of the Basin</div>
<div style="margin-top:10px;font-family:'Cinzel','Trajan Pro',serif;font-size:28px;font-weight:700;color:#F0E7D9;">Then His Eyes Find Yours</div>
</div>

<div style="margin:0 30px 34px;text-align:center;">
<div style="font-family:'Cinzel','Trajan Pro',serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#C97E4B;">He does not rise to greet you.</div>
<div style="margin-top:5px;font-family:'Cinzel','Trajan Pro',serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#8FA27B;">He simply watches.</div>
<div style="margin:20px auto 0;max-width:580px;text-align:left;font-size:15px;line-height:1.82;color:#E8E0D2;">
Golden eyes meet yours with the calm certainty of someone who has ruled for centuries. Water continues to fall. Leaves continue to stir. Yet every living thing seems to wait for his first word.
</div>
</div>

<div style="padding:0 30px 34px;">
<div style="text-align:center;font-family:'Cinzel','Trajan Pro',serif;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:5px;color:#C97E4B;text-transform:uppercase;">Vaeshyr Ith’Kael</div>
<div style="margin-top:19px;padding:23px 21px;background:#2C342D;border:1px solid rgba(143,162,123,.34);font-size:18px;line-height:1.85;font-style:italic;color:#F0E7D9;">
“Welcome.”
<br><br>
“You crossed half of Asterra to stand within my kingdom.”
</div>
<div style="margin:20px auto 0;max-width:580px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.82;color:#E8E0D2;">
His voice carries effortlessly across the water—deep, measured, neither warm nor unkind.
<br><br>
A faint smile touches one corner of his mouth.
</div>
</div>

<div style="padding:34px 30px 40px;text-align:center;background:radial-gradient(circle at bottom,rgba(143,162,123,.11),transparent 48%),#1E241F;border-top:1px solid rgba(143,162,123,.30);">
<div style="max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;font-size:15px;line-height:1.82;color:#E8E0D2;">
One broad hand settles against the sun-warmed stone beside him. His tail shifts beneath the water, sending rings of emerald light across the pool between you.
<br><br>
He does not order you closer.
<br><br>
He waits.
</div>

<div style="margin:24px auto 0;padding:24px 21px;max-width:530px;background:#2C342D;border:1px solid rgba(201,126,75,.38);box-shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.28);font-size:19px;line-height:1.85;font-style:italic;color:#F0E7D9;">
“Now tell me...”
<br><br>
“Why do you think I invited you?”
</div>

